{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41214","headline":"梁郊祀乐章 庆肃 · 张衮","name":"梁郊祀乐章 庆肃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"笾豆簠簋，黍稷非馨。\n懿兹彝器，厥德惟明。\n金石匏革，以和以平。\n由此无疆，期乎永宁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张衮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41214.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41214","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}